    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live hard and drive fast.  When you need to get somewhere, collateral damage is not your concern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your beloved Big Blue, and go further than ever before.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lane-locked controls means precision dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful pneumatic suspension enables big-air jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy armor makes you invulnerable to most collisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No brakes suggests you are not afraid of commitment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great power brings significant fuel consumption.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will be a fun, fast ride through six distinctly-styled biomes, but honestly you might be too busy to notice.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live hard and drive fast.  When you need to get somewhere, collateral damage is not your concern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your beloved Big Blue, and go further than ever before.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lane-locked controls means precision dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful pneumatic suspension enables big-air jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy armor makes you invulnerable to most collisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No brakes suggests you are not afraid of commitment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great power brings significant fuel consumption.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will be a fun, fast ride through six distinctly-styled biomes, but honestly you might be too busy to notice.</p>",
    "short_description": "An infinite runner driving game where collisions are rewarded!\u00a0 Take out enemies and dodge hazards as you travel through six different biomes and chase the highest score.",
